# Font binaries stay out of the repo — the title face is the exception:
# it is a 2 KB prepared subset that has to exist at build time, or the
# @font-face in layout.css has nothing to load. Rebuild with
# `npm run subset-font`; the rest of this directory stays untracked.
static/fonts/*
!static/fonts/ma-shan-zheng.woff2
